      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-06T03:23:13.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-06 11:23:13",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "See you soon, Mars.\n\nOur twin spacecraft – Blue & Gold – are about to execute a trans-Mars Injection maneuver to propel themselves to Mars.\n\nSince launch 12 months ago, the spacecraft we designed and built for @NASA and @ucbssl for the  @escapade_mars mission, have been in space making small course corrections.\n\nNow that Earth and Mars are aligned, each spacecraft will ignite their engines for about 9 minutes each, to begin their journey to the Red Planet to study its atmosphere.\n\nBlue’s engine burn takes place:  Saturday 7th November\nGold’s engine burn takes place: Monday 9th November\n\nLearn more about this epic scientific mission here: https://rocketlabcorp.com/missions/escapade/",
