      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Explorer spacecraft x2 \n\nBlue & Gold are two near-identical spacecraft designed from our Explorer-class spacecraft platform – a high delta-V, interplanetary member of our advanced satellites family. They weigh 535 kilograms each when fueled (wet) or 209 kg each dry.",
