      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Get ready: Trans-Mars Injection incoming.\n\nOur two spacecraft - Blue & Gold - will slingshot Earth and shoot for Mars in four days.\n\nThe @escapade_mars mission for @NASA & @ucbssl is preparing for TMI – a critical maneuver in this epic interplanetary mission.\n\nBlue’s engine burn scheduled:  Saturday 7th November\nGold’s engine burn scheduled: Monday 9th November\n\nLearn more about ESCAPADE here: https://rocketlabcorp.com/missions/escapade/",
